#, php-format
msgid "Metric Configuration [ edit: %s - %s ]"
msgstr "Saitin Ma'auni [ gyara: %s - %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Metric Configuration [new]"
msgstr "Saitin Ma'auni [sabo]"

#: templates.php
msgid "The explanation given to this measurand. This will be shown as legend within exports as well as a tooltip within the presentation of a report itself."
msgstr "Bayanin da aka bayar don wannan abin aunawa. Za a nuna wannan a matsayin ma'anar alama a cikin fitar da bayanai da kuma a matsayin bayanin nuni a cikin gabatar da rahoton da kansa."

#: templates.php
msgid "Define a unique abbreviation for this measurand with max. 8 letters/numbers."
msgstr "Bayyana gajeren suna na musamman don wannan abin aunawa mai iyakar haruffa/lambobi 8."

#: templates.php
msgid "The unit given to this measurand. e.g. 'Bits/s'"
msgstr "Rukunin awo da aka ba wannan ma'aunin. misali 'Bits/s'"

#: templates.php
msgid "Consolidation function"
msgstr "Aikin haɗawa wuri guda"

#: templates.php
msgid "The name of the consolidation function to define which CDPs should be read out."
msgstr "Sunan aikin haɗawa don ayyana waɗanne CDPs ya kamata a karanta."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand should be become part of the final report output. Leave it unflagged if this measurands will only be used as an auxiliary calculation."
msgstr "Zaɓi 'enable' idan wannan abin aunawa zai zama wani ɓangare na sakamakon rahoton ƙarshe. Bar shi ba tare da alama ba idan za a yi amfani da wannan abin aunawa ne kawai a matsayin lissafin taimako."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand will only have one result in total instead of one for every Data Source Item. It's result<br>will be shown separately. Use this option in combination with \"Visible\" = \"off\" if you are looking for a measurand keeping an interim result only that should be reused within the calculation of other measurands without being visible for end users."
msgstr "Zaɓi 'enable' idan wannan abin aunawa zai sami sakamako ɗaya ne kawai gaba ɗaya maimakon ɗaya ga kowane Abin Tushen Bayanai. Za a nuna sakamakonsa<br>daban. Yi amfani da wannan zaɓin tare da \"Visible\" = \"off\" idan kana neman abin aunawa da ke riƙe da sakamakon wucin gadi kawai wanda za a sake amfani da shi wajen lissafin sauran abubuwan aunawa ba tare da ya bayyana ga masu amfani na ƙarshe ba."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formatting"
msgstr "Tsara salo"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines as what type the data should be treated as."
msgstr "Yana bayyana wane nau'i ya kamata a ɗauki bayanan a matsayinsa."

#: templates.php
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "Daidaito"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines how many decimal digits should be displayed for floating-point numbers."
msgstr "Yana bayyana adadin lambobin goma da za a nuna don lambobin da ke da ɗigo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Prefixes"
msgstr "Ƙarin gaba"

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose the type of prefix being used to format the result. With the use of decimal prefixes '1024' will be formatted to '1.024k' while the binary prefixes option returns '1ki'. Select 'off' to display the raw data, here '1024'."
msgstr "Zaɓi nau'in harafin gaba da za a yi amfani da shi wajen tsara sakamakon. Idan aka yi amfani da harafin gaba na goma-goma za a tsara '1024' zuwa '1.024k' yayin da zaɓin harafin gaba na biyu-biyu ke mayar da '1ki'. Zaɓi 'off' don nuna ainihin bayanan kai tsaye, a nan '1024'."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "Tsarin Lissafi"

#: templates.php
msgid "The mathematical definition of this measurand. Allowed are all combinations of operators and operands listed below following the rules of mathematics. Use round and square brackets to signify complex terms and the order of operations."
msgstr "Ma'anar lissafi ta wannan abin aunawa. An yarda da duk haɗin alamomin lissafi da lambobin aiki da aka jera a ƙasa bisa ƙa'idodin lissafi. Yi amfani da baka mai zagaye da mai kusurwa don nuna kalmomi masu sarƙaƙiya da tsarin ayyuka."

#: templates.php
msgid "Operators & Operands"
msgstr "Alamomin Aiki da Abubuwan Aiki"

#: templates.php
msgid "Click on one of the listed operators or operand to append them to your calucalion formula. The tooltip will show you additional information like description, return value, arguments and usage."
msgstr "Danna ɗaya daga cikin masu aiki ko abubuwan lissafi da aka jera don haɗa su zuwa tsarin lissafinka. Akwatin bayani zai nuna maka ƙarin bayani kamar kwatance, ƙimar dawowa, hujjoji da amfani."

